      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds nice in theory but it doesn't change the fact that i'm ruined. i look around and everything just feels empty and fake. like, why bother even trying to exist in a world that's this broken? it's like you're just waiting for the next thing to hit you. i don't see any real way out of this feeling, other than just... not being part of it anymore.",
